	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/ameriwest-lithium-unlocking-value-in-a-world-shifting-toward-lithium-based-energy-solutions/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header-672x372.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Ameriwest Lithium: Unlocking value in a world shifting toward lithium-based energy solutions" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header-672x372.png 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header-300x166.png 300w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header-1024x568.png 1024w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header-768x426.png 768w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header.png 1038w" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="8810" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/ameriwest-lithium-unlocking-value-in-a-world-shifting-toward-lithium-based-energy-solutions/2022_cse_mag_issue_4_ameriwest-lithium_blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header.png" data-orig-size="1038,576" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest Lithium_Blog Header" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2022_CSE_Mag_Issue_4_Ameriwest-Lithium_Blog-Header-1024x568.png" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-magazine/" rel="category tag">Magazine</a></span>
