<article id="post-8758" class="post-8758 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-american-pacific-mining tag-ameriwest-lithium tag-cse-magazine tag-cseawli tag-cseelem tag-csefni tag-cseibat tag-cseqni tag-cseusgd tag-fathom-nickel tag-international-battery-metals">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-mining-issue-now-live/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/CSE_2022-Issue-4_New-Issue_Blog-Header-672x372.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine: The Mining Issue – Now Live!" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/CSE_2022-Issue-4_New-Issue_Blog-Header-672x372.png 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/CSE_2022-Issue-4_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1038x576.png 1038w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="8762" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-mining-issue-now-live/cse_2022-issue-4_new-issue_blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/CSE_2022-Issue-4_New-Issue_Blog-Header.png" data-orig-size="1920,1080" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="CSE_2022 Issue 4_New Issue_Blog Header" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/CSE_2022-Issue-4_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1024x576.png" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-magazine/" rel="category tag">Magazine</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-mining-issue-now-live/" rel="bookmark">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine: The Mining Issue – Now Live!</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-mining-issue-now-live/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2022-06-13T08:30:00-04:00">June 13, 2022</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Welcome to the latest issue of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">, your source for in-depth stories of entrepreneurs from a wealth of different industries.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The more the world changes, the more entrepreneurs seek out new opportunities to adapt. No industry has shown a capacity for resilience quite like the mining industry has, and the CSE has witnessed firsthand the resurgence in interest in mining and exploration companies going public.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In this issue of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">, we highlight individuals and companies who are helping to provide opportunities in the mining space closer to home. We shine a spotlight on a mining-focused diversity and inclusion expert and six publicly-listed mining companies on the CSE that are putting the pedal to the metal to meet demand.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The CSE-listed companies featured in this issue include:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">American Pacific Mining (</span><a href="https://www.thecse.com/en/listings/mining/american-pacific-mining-corp"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:USGD</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Ameriwest Lithium (</span><a href="https://www.thecse.com/en/listings/mining/ameriwest-lithium-inc"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:AWLI</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Element79 Gold (</span><a href="https://www.thecse.com/en/listings/mining/element79-gold-corp"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:ELEM</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Fathom Nickel (</span><a href="https://www.thecse.com/en/listings/mining/fathom-nickel-inc"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:FNI</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">International Battery Metals (</span><a href="https://www.thecse.com/en/listings/mining/international-battery-metals-ltd"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:IBAT</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Quebec Nickel (</span><a href="https://www.thecse.com/en/listings/mining/quebec-nickel-corp"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:QNI</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Check out Mining Issue of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazin</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">e here:</span></p>
